            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Nova atualização</h1><p>New content just added to Majesty 2 Collection:<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2 New Classes (Ice Mage, Assassin)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>6 Spells<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>9 Abilities<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>8 Missions<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>6 Weapon Upgrades<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>In the world of Majesty, you are the ruler of the Kingdom. Your rule is not absolute, however, as you face subjects that are independent and stubborn. They will need a great deal of persuasion before they carry out your wishes...<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tIncludes all Majesty 2 content:<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Majesty 2<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Kingmaker expansion<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Battles of Ardania expansion<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Monster Kingdom expansion<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>The Kingmaker game editor enables players to create their own missions. Also included is every item, quest, unit and building previously only available for purchase using the in-game store. This additional content includes new spells, weapons, units, heroes, buildings, quests and more.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features:</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Real-time strategy with indirect control – your heroes have a will of their own<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Build the ultimate fantasy kingdom and experience an engaging world, but beware: monsters are waiting to lay siege to your domain <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Defend your realm with noble warriors, spell-wielding wizards, or wild barbarians <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Multiplayer for up to 4 players over LAN<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "In the world of Majesty, you are the ruler of the Kingdom. Your rule is not absolute, however, as you face subjects that are independent and stubborn. They will need a great deal of persuasion before they carry out your wishes...<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tIncludes all Majesty 2 content:<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Majesty 2<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Kingmaker expansion<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Battles of Ardania expansion<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Monster Kingdom expansion<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>The Kingmaker game editor enables players to create their own missions. Also included is every item, quest, unit and building previously only available for purchase using the in-game store. This additional content includes new spells, weapons, units, heroes, buildings, quests and more.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features:</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Real-time strategy with indirect control – your heroes have a will of their own<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Build the ultimate fantasy kingdom and experience an engaging world, but beware: monsters are waiting to lay siege to your domain <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Defend your realm with noble warriors, spell-wielding wizards, or wild barbarians <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Multiplayer for up to 4 players over LAN<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "In the world of Majesty, you are the ruler of the Kingdom. Your rule is not absolute, however, as you face subjects that are independent and stubborn. They will need a great deal of persuasion before they carry out your wishes...",
